# Errant Minion: "At the beginning of the upkeep of enchanted creature's controller, that player may pay any amount of mana. This Aura
# deals 2 damage to that player. Prevent X of that damage, where X is the amount of mana that player paid this way." Bot1 casts it on
# Bot2's Memnite (not on its own Mox Pearl: enchant creature). On turn 4, Bot2's upkeep, Bot2 - the enchanted creature's controller,
# not the Aura's - pays one mana (Mox Sapphire) and is dealt 1 of the 2 damage. On turn 6 Bot2 declines and is dealt all 2
# (CR 118.12, 608.2c, 615.7). Bot1, the Aura's controller, is dealt nothing.

